<title>UK: Commerzbank sets call, put warrants on 10-yr Bund.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets call, put warrants on 10-yr Bund.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerzbank AG said it has issued a total of 80 million American-style call and put warrants, in eight equal tranches, on the 6.0 percent German Bund due 2007.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 04.FEB.97-23.JAN.98   PAYDATE	28.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT/DUES</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT    STRIKE     ISSUE    * WARRANT   STRIKE    ISSUE</p>
<p> CALL A     100 PCT    2.20 DEM *  PUT A     98 PCT   1.92 DEM</p>
<p> CALL B     101 PCT    1.61 DEM *  PUT B     99 PCT   2.40 DEM</p>
<p> CALL C     102 PCT    1.16 DEM *  PUT C    100 PCT   2.94 DEM</p>
<p> CALL D     103 PCT    0.82 DEM *  PUT D    101 PCT   3.55 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
